# Ouster driver metadata dump. ouster_ros writes <sensor-ip>-metadata.json into
# the *current working directory* when the driver's `metadata` param is empty,
# so launching from the repo root drops one here. The bag carries the same data
# on /ouster/metadata, so the loose file is disposable.
*-metadata.json
third_party/
